RMVPE (Robust Model for Vocal Pitch Estimation in Polyphonic Music)

The neural network classes in this directory (deepunet.py, seq.py) are taken
from the Dream-High/RMVPE repository on GitHub, commit
a6db1cd7d26014aa739383367afd9bab57fc624c (src/deepunet.py, src/seq.py),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this
directory).

Changes: constants.py is new and holds only N_MELS = 128, the value the
RVC-project checkpoint was trained with (the upstream constants.py says 256,
which only affects encoder bookkeeping, not parameter shapes). The two copied
files are otherwise unmodified.

The weights are not part of this repository. They are the RVC project's
`rmvpe.pt` (MIT), downloaded at image build time and verified by sha256; see
apps/note-detector/Dockerfile.
